torname{dom}(\\mathrm{Ax})\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal F\\mid\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\},\\qquad\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Ax})\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\pi_2(\\mathcal F)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Ax})\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal F\\mid\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\},\\qquad\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Ax})\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\pi_2(\\mathcal F)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>的公理集</li>\n<li>公理是无需前提就可证的公式</li>\n<li>单元素序列<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi)\">\\((\\varphi)\\)</span>是公理<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的证明</li>\n<li>一般形式系统的公理集不必有效；“可判定”或“可枚举”是另加的有效性条件</li>\n<li>本书后续另行验证系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的公理集具有所需的有效性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-axiom-set-—-Axiom-Set-$\\mathrm{Ax}$","text":"df-axiom-set — Axiom Set $\\mathrm{Ax}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F}$ (formal system, see [[92-df-formal-system]])